      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a concise Quick Start guide for VortexScale:\n\n**Deploying VortexScale in Under 5 Minutes**\n=============================================\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n\n- Docker installed (`docker --version`)\n- AWS CLI configured with a valid API key (`aws --version` and `aws sts get-caller-identity --query ' Shibboleth AuthenticationName}`)\n- VortexScale API key obtained (`vortex login --key YOUR_API_KEY`)\n\n**Setup:**\n\n1. Log in to VortexScale with your API key: `vortex login --key YOUR_API_KEY`\n2. Create a new project: `vortex init --project <NAME>`\n\n**Deploy:**\n\n1. Deploy your environment to production: `vortex deploy --env prod`\n\nThis guide focuses on the essential steps to get VortexScale up and running quickly, without compromising technical density.",
