      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, really clean. But looking at the Completeness Score on this draft, it's coming back pretty low—like, super low. I'm worried the automated system is going to flag this as \"insufficient documentation\" and bury it in the search results.\n\nCan you expand it a bit? I'm not looking for fluff, but maybe you could add some context around the commands or explain the prerequisites in more detail so the documentation feels more \"complete\" for the scoring system. Just please make sure it stays technically relevant for a DevOps engineer; I don't want a wall of text that doesn't actually help anyone.",
